oming LLMs into your workflow to generate, transform, and analyze code.\n- Chat with teammates, write notes together, and share your screen and project. All included.\n- Zed now speaks WSL. You can open a Linux distro as a first-class “remote” target, edit projects that live inside it.\n- All of Zed’s AI features, including edit predictions and ACP-powered agents, are fully supported on Windows.\n- All Zed extensions now work seamlessly on Windows; no special steps, no caveats.\n- To run on almost all Windows versions, including VMs, we created a new rendering backend based on DirectX 11.","name":"Zed Preview","packageUrl":"https://zed.dev/windows","publisher":"Zed Industries","publisherUrl":"https://zed.dev/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/zed-industries/zed/releases/tag/v1.25.1-pre","tags":["code-editor","developer-tools","editor","text-editor"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://zed.dev/","releaseDate":"2026-10-20","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/zed-industries/zed/releases/tag/v1.25.1-pre","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/z/ZedIndustries/Zed/Preview/1.25.1-pre/ZedIndustries.Zed.Preview.yaml","sha256":"82b2a7ad9bac24c462969ed54ac1e35ae20b7eaaa41baa8c7e47cb230f0d8ed6"},{"path":"manifests/z/ZedIndustries/Zed/Preview/1.25.1-pre/ZedIndustries.Zed.Preview.installer.yaml","sha256":"420aa94cea3c0074836bcc3e0fc7501b3dbe2d0887b37c66b96fb94e130f1b20"},{"path":"manifests/z/ZedIndustries/Zed/Preview/1.25.1-pre/ZedIndustries.Zed.Preview.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"c6005414c0e7c6d14c2fb1cdf907120d49a73730f9c842c055196737452b4aaa"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"1.25.1-pre"}